tore_item_assets/steam/apps/2964210/extras/3e878bf269dea9c69509b6b593ce4fec.poster.avif?t=1742641576\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964210/extras/3e878bf269dea9c69509b6b593ce4fec.webm?t=1742641576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2964210/extras/3e878bf269dea9c69509b6b593ce4fec.mp4?t=1742641576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore</strong><br>Pause for a moment and look what you created. Hamlet in A Pond invites you to explore your own village. Meet its inhabitants, count the sheep or zoom out and see your hamlet bustling.",
